{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person, point-and-click adventure set in a retro-futuristic, post-apocalyptic world where giant insects and abandoned robots reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801100/extras/01_GoToTower_EZ.gif?t=1752227775\" /></div>Take your time to explore and find your way.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801100/extras/02_BoltCutter_EZ.gif?t=1752227775\" /></div>Pick up items that can be used later.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801100/extras/01_Molotov_Combo_EZ.gif?t=1752227775\" /></div>Combine specific items to create new ones in your inventory.<br><br>FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive locations with realistic sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursor animations when hovering over hidden items in the scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clicking on interactive objects displays a hand-drawn sketch illustrating the expected action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect objects to use later in other scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop items on specific spots to trigger actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cinematic sequences triggered by player actions, advancing the story and unlocking new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine certain objects directly in the inventory to solve puzzles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801100?t=1752227775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801100?t=1752227775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801100/ef4